# Cross-Engine Shader & Rendering Pipeline (`cross-engine-shader-rendering`)

Universal shader compilation, HLSL/GLSL/SPIR-V transpilation, Cook-Torrance PBR math, and dynamic post-processing effects.

## Pipelines
- **Cross-Compilation:** Author single-source shaders and compile via `glslangValidator`, `spirv-opt`, and SPIRV-Cross into Vulkan SPIR-V, DX12 HLSL, and OpenGL GLSL:
  `python3 config/skills/cross-engine-shader-rendering/scripts/shader_transpile_validate.py`
- **Weather & Post-Processing:** Sun shafts, progressive bloom, and HDR tonemapping tuning:
  `python3 config/skills/cross-engine-shader-rendering/scripts/weather_lighting_tuner.py`

